Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Desktop launcher: required official-BIOS row with picker

Same correction as the Android launcher: XD cannot detect an Emerald
booted by the bundled open-source BIOS on this core, so the official dump
is a hard requirement, not an optional nicety. The row shows red until an
official BIOS is configured, the picker hash-validates the chosen file,
and the existing folder auto-discovery still imports one silently when it
sits next to the XD ISO.
